{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":91,"count":28,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L01-1-14\",\"日本\",\"日本\",\"日本\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我知道，她是日本人。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhīdào, tā shì Rìběn rén.","english":"Yes, I do. She is from Japan.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-1-01","sourceFront":"新","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我是日本人，你呢？","pinyin":"Wǒ shì Rìběn rén, nǐ ne?","english":"I am from Japan. How about you?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-01","sourceFront":"什麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我有一位英國老師和兩位日本老師。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu yí wèi Yīngguó lǎoshī hé liǎng wèi Rìběn lǎoshī.","english":"I have one British teacher and two Japanese teachers.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-09","sourceFront":"位","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我旁邊有日本同學，前面跟後面都有美國同學。","pinyin":"Wǒ pángbiān yǒu Rìběn tóngxué, qiánmiàn gēn hòumiàn dōu yǒu Měiguó tóngxué.","english":"There are Japanese classmates beside me, and there are American classmates in front and behind.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-23","sourceFront":"後（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"日(sun) + 本(origin) → 'origin of the sun', the land where it rises: 日本 is Japan."},{"key":"[\"B1L03-2-24\",\"件\",\"件\",\"件\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這件衣服的顏色很漂亮。","pinyin":"Zhè jiàn yīfu de yánsè hěn piàoliang.","english":"The color of this clothing is very pretty.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-23","sourceFront":"衣服","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你的錢包在那件衣服下面。","pinyin":"Nǐ de qiánbāo zài nà jiàn yīfu xiàmiàn.","english":"Your wallet is under that piece of clothing.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-20","sourceFront":"下（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) takes a 牛(ox) down to market → one 件(item)."},{"key":"[\"B1L04-1-23\",\"牛肉麵\",\"牛肉麵\",\"牛肉面\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"太好了！我最愛吃牛肉麵。他們也賣飲料嗎？","pinyin":"Tài hǎo le! Wǒ zuì ài chī niúròu miàn. Tāmen yě mài yǐnliào ma?","english":"That is awesome! Beef noodles is my favorite. Do they sell drinks as well?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這家餐廳人太多，我們去那家餐廳，好嗎？他們的牛肉麵很好吃，也很便宜。","pinyin":"Zhè jiā cāntīng rén tài duō. Wǒmen qù nà jiā cāntīng, hǎo ma? Tāmen de niúròu miàn hěn hǎochī, yě hěn piányi.","english":"There are too many people in this restaurant. How about that restaurant? They have delicious beef noodles, and it is also cheap.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"A：你想點什麼？ B：我想點一碗牛肉麵。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ xiǎng diǎn shénme? B: Wǒ xiǎng diǎn yì wǎn niúròu miàn.","english":"A: What would you like to order? B: I want to order a bowl of beef noodles.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"小姐，我們要點兩碗牛肉麵和兩杯茶。","pinyin":"Xiǎojiě, wǒmen yào diǎn liǎng wǎn niúròu miàn hé liǎng bēi chá.","english":"Miss, we would like to order two bowls of beef noodles and two cups of tea.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"牛(cow) + 肉(meat) + 麵(noodles) → beef noodles."},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-26\",\"国家公园\",\"國家公園\",\"国家公园\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個國家公園的服務中心提供遊客簡介，介紹公園的特色和有名的景點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-03","sourceFront":"簡介","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-37\",\"记下来\",\"記下來\",\"记下来\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我把搭車的日期、時間都記下來了。","pinyin":"Wǒ bǎ dā chē de rìqī, shíjiān dōu jì xiàlái le.","english":"I have written down the date and time of the train ride.","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-31","sourceFront":"日期","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"A:我太糊塗了，忘了把變更後的網路銀行密碼記下來。 B:這下子你得親自去銀行處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-26","sourceFront":"變更","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-15\",\"海报\",\"海報\",\"海报\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這條路不平，有民眾貼了海報，請大家走路時要小心，以免受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-26","sourceFront":"以免","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-25\",\"恋爱\",\"戀愛\",\"恋爱\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我姐姐最近戀愛了，每個週末都跟男朋友約會。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiějie zuìjìn liàn'ài le, měi ge zhōumò dōu gēn nánpéngyou yuēhuì.","english":"My older sister has recently fallen in love; every weekend she goes on dates with her boyfriend.","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-25","sourceFront":"戀愛","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"雲小姐最近突然開始化妝了，人也變美了。大家都猜她戀愛了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-14","sourceFront":"猜","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個我覺得最難忘的回憶應該是跟「第一次」相關的經驗，比如第一次戀愛、第一次當背包客等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-15","sourceFront":"難忘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"佳佳認為談戀愛的對象，年齡不重要，容不容易溝通、個性適不適合才是最重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-24","sourceFront":"年齡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"談戀愛時不能太花心，(也)就是說不能見一個就愛一個。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-46","sourceFront":"就是說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"春天是花開的季節，在愛情故事中，往往也是適合戀愛的季節。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-04","sourceFront":"開","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在自由戀愛的時代中，還是有人透過相親的方式來認識另一半。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-11","sourceFront":"相親","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-2-21\",\"保守\",\"保守\",\"保守\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在古代，大多數的人思想很保守。","pinyin":"Zài gǔdài, dàduōshù de rén sīxiǎng hěn bǎoshǒu.","english":"In ancient times, most people's thinking was very conservative.","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-21","sourceFront":"保守","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在古代，大多數的人思想很保守。","pinyin":"Zài gǔdài, dàduōshù de rén sīxiǎng hěn bǎoshǒu.","english":"In ancient times, most people's thinking was very conservative.","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-20","sourceFront":"思想","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"在古代，大多數的人思想很保守。","pinyin":"Zài gǔdài, dàduōshù de rén sīxiǎng hěn bǎoshǒu.","english":"In ancient times, most people's thinking was very conservative.","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-19","sourceFront":"古代","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他對發展新科技向來保守，不願接受人工智慧產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-19","sourceFront":"向來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-2-10\",\"保证\",\"保證\",\"保证\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"沒有人能保證上了有名的大學，未來就一定快樂、幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-10","sourceFront":"保證","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你得把保證書帶來，我們才能幫你免費修理電腦。","pinyin":"Nǐ děi bǎ bǎozhèngshū dàilái, wǒmen cái néng bāng nǐ miǎnfèi xiūlǐ diànnǎo.","english":"You have to bring the warranty, and only then can we help you repair the computer for free.","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-20","sourceFront":"修理","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你說這部筆電可以用三年，你能給我什麼保證？","pinyin":"Nǐ shuō zhè bù bǐdiàn kěyǐ yòng sān nián, nǐ néng gěi wǒ shénme bǎozhèng?","english":"You say this laptop can be used for three years—what guarantee can you give me?","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-19","sourceFront":"保證","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"只要你堅持每天學習一個小時的中文，我保證你的程度一定會越來越好的","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-07","sourceFront":"堅持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個老闆做生意不老實，一再跟客人保證商品沒問題，其實是騙人的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-08","sourceFront":"老實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統到地震災區慰問災民，並保證會協助他們恢復正常的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-09","sourceFront":"慰問","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大多數投資專家都不敢保證在房屋市場一定能賺錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-03","sourceFront":"專家","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自動化工廠不僅使生產速度更快，同時也能保證產品品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-46","sourceFront":"自動化","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-2-15\",\"模特兒\",\"模特兒\",\"模特儿\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"何小姐是一名模特兒，也會自己設計服裝，這幾張圖裡的裙子都是她畫的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-19","sourceFront":"設計","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"美美剛進模特兒公司時，有一位導演找她演戲，沒想到就讓她變成了有名的明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-12","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我認為多看時尚雜誌、多看模特兒怎麼穿衣服，應該就能使自己的穿著更有品味。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-17","sourceFront":"使","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個模特兒個子高、長得美，從什麼角度拍都漂亮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-10","sourceFront":"角度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大多數的模特兒都是腿長腰細的，穿什麼服裝都好看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-42","sourceFront":"細","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位模特兒曾多次參與連續劇演出，相當受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-44","sourceFront":"參與","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A runway model displaying stylish 模(model) design with 特(special) poise and 兒(son) charm: 模特兒 means model."},{"key":"[\"B3L06-2-09\",\"噪音\",\"噪音\",\"噪音\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我家在大馬路旁，從早到晚噪音不斷，嚴重影響了生活品質，所以決定搬家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-09","sourceFront":"噪音","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"要維持社區良好的生活品質，就要從不亂丟垃圾、減少家庭噪音做起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-13","sourceFront":"維持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Harsh clatter from 噪(be noisy) creating irritating 音(sound): 噪音 means noise."},{"key":"[\"B3L11-2-14\",\"传\",\"傳\",\"传\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我等一下要開會，不方便接電話，有事就用手機傳訊息給我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-14","sourceFront":"傳","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"臺灣南部不僅天氣好、旅遊景點多，還有各式各樣的傳統小吃，很值得去走走。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-02","sourceFront":"景點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"照華人的傳統習慣，女人生完孩子就要坐月子，一直在家休息到孩子滿月。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-01","sourceFront":"坐月子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"何小姐習慣去傳統市場買水果，而且都跟同一個攤販買。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-07","sourceFront":"攤販","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"為了參加同事的婚禮，我打算當天穿上很有特色的中國傳統服裝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-03","sourceFront":"婚禮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老闆去歐洲旅遊回來，買了荷蘭傳統的點心送給大家，叫我們去助理那裡領。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-05","sourceFront":"領","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我爺爺的想法很傳統，除夕一定要大家回去吃年夜飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ yéye de xiǎngfǎ hěn chuántǒng, Chúxī yídìng yào dàjiā huíqù chī niányèfàn.","english":"My grandfather's thinking is very traditional; on New Year's Eve, he insists that everyone go back to eat the New Year's Eve dinner.","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-07","sourceFront":"傳統","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"對華人來說，把書念好才有美好的未來，這個傳統觀念在臺灣已經慢慢改變了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-14","sourceFront":"觀念","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代人往往以網路傳訊息，代替傳統寫信或打電話的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-15","sourceFront":"往往","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次亞洲文化展，除了樂器表演，還有傳統服裝試穿活動，歡迎各位來參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-01","sourceFront":"各位","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以電腦系統取代傳統收停車費的方式，能幫老闆節省工作人員的費用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-05","sourceFront":"系統","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"明天的會議資料我已經上傳到雲端，請各位開會前先了解要討論的內容。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-23","sourceFront":"上傳","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師先把跟課程相關的學習資料上傳到雲端，讓學生預習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-27","sourceFront":"預習","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在古代中國，男人不應該進廚房的傳統觀念，也因為時代的改變而不同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-01","sourceFront":"時代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這份文件很急，請你下班以前傳真給對方公司。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-36","sourceFront":"傳真","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有張紙卡在傳真機裡，你拿得出來嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-38","sourceFront":"卡","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位服裝設計師相當喜愛十八世紀時的歐洲傳統風格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-02","sourceFront":"世紀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你把廣告設計得那麼小，這樣的宣傳怎麼有效果呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-22","sourceFront":"宣傳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他利用發傳單的方式來宣傳自己新開的餐廳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-23","sourceFront":"傳單","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣人常用花生、紅豆做傳統點心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-38","sourceFront":"花生","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國人看傳統戲劇時都喜歡準備一盤瓜子，邊吃邊欣賞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-39","sourceFront":"瓜子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他今天去傳統市場買菜，特別做了拿手菜招待好友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-24","sourceFront":"特別","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些國家的傳統戲劇常利用影子和燈光效果來表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-19","sourceFront":"影子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"商品想賣得好，就得準備一筆廣告費，多多宣傳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-56","sourceFront":"多多","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"水災過後應立刻打掃環境，才能降低傳染病流行的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-03","sourceFront":"傳染病","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次傳染病的病毒很厲害，出門得戴著口罩，免得被傳染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-06","sourceFront":"傳染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"按照中國的傳統觀念，女人未嫁時得聽父親的話，嫁了人之後就得聽丈夫的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-43","sourceFront":"丈夫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們公司的大型宴會活動，一向是宣傳部門負責處理的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-55","sourceFront":"宴會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"手機廠商時常邀請明星替他們的產品宣傳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-14","sourceFront":"廠商","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從事電視新聞工作的人有義務傳播正確的消息。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-15","sourceFront":"傳播","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"包著紅豆餡，裹著花生粉的麻糬，是臺灣著名的傳統甜點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-37","sourceFront":"裹","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從過去到現在，尊敬長輩一直是華人最重視的傳統觀念之一。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-39","sourceFront":"傳統","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家旅行社有宣傳活動，所以裡頭、外頭都站滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-42","sourceFront":"外頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳說月亮上住著一隻兔子，這個神話留給孩子們許多想像空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-04","sourceFront":"傳說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳統私立高中有許多規定，在管理學生方面相當嚴格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-10","sourceFront":"私立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那棟沒有主人的房屋充滿恐怖的傳說，一般人都不願意靠近。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-31","sourceFront":"恐怖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"做生意與其花大錢廣告，不如提高品質，讓顧客替你宣傳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-27","sourceFront":"廣告","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-24\",\"规定\",\"規定\",\"规定\",\"N/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那所學校規定學生不能帶手機上學，是希望他們專心學習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-24","sourceFront":"規定","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在我們學校，上課時是不能使用手機的，連老師也不能破壞規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-24","sourceFront":"規定","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"學校規定新生必須在開學前一週完成註冊手續。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-34","sourceFront":"註冊","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"部分國家規定，騎腳踏車時是不能載人的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-13","sourceFront":"載","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"向圖書館借的書籍要是超過規定的時間沒還，可是要罰錢的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-31","sourceFront":"罰","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這所學校規定學生每兩週至少參加一次服務學習活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-09","sourceFront":"週","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據規定，每位旅客只能攜帶一件七公斤以下的行李上飛機。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-13","sourceFront":"旅客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"班機起飛前，服務人員都會為旅客說明應注意的安全規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-43","sourceFront":"班機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些運動中心規定個人得帶自己的毛巾，否則不可以進去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-05","sourceFront":"毛巾","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前學校規定女學生的髮型都要一樣，而且長度不能超過耳朵。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-18","sourceFront":"髮型","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些國家機場對攜帶物品的規定很嚴，出國前最好了解清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-25","sourceFront":"嚴","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院的規定一條又一條的，看得我眼睛都累了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-50","sourceFront":"條","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"環保署規定禁止使用塑膠袋後，使用購物袋的人就漸漸增加了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-24","sourceFront":"漸漸","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"按照我國官方規定，民間辦理環保活動可向官方申請經費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-03","sourceFront":"官方","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣的小學教導孩子從平常生活中學習遵守規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-10","sourceFront":"遵守","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據本大樓的管理規定，私人物品不可堆在公共區域。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-25","sourceFront":"私人","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司來了位新同事，老闆要我向他一一介紹公司的規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-41","sourceFront":"一一","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳統私立高中有許多規定，在管理學生方面相當嚴格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-10","sourceFront":"私立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據醫院規定，進入病房後禁止大聲說話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-29","sourceFront":"進入","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司全體都支持昨天公告的那條規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-18","sourceFront":"全體","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這項規定是由大會成員一起討論後決定的，必須嚴格遵守。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-19","sourceFront":"大會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"裁判的工作是確定每位選手都遵守規定，讓比賽順利進行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-25","sourceFront":"裁判","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-31\",\"人民币\",\"人民幣\",\"人民币\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"中國開放國內投資後，想投資人民幣的人也越來越多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-31","sourceFront":"人民幣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-43\",\"筆\",\"筆\",\"笔\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你的筆在那本書上面。","pinyin":"Nǐ de bǐ zài nà běn shū shàngmiàn.","english":"Your pen is on top of the book.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-13","sourceFront":"上（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這枝筆太貴了，你買便宜的吧。","pinyin":"Zhè zhī bǐ tài guì le, nǐ mǎi piányi de ba.","english":"This pen is too expensive, you had better buy a cheaper one.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-14","sourceFront":"吧","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A：你喜歡紅色的筆嗎？ B：我喜歡白的。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ xǐhuān hóngsè de bǐ ma? B: Wǒ xǐhuān bái de.","english":"A: Do you like red pens? B: I like white pens.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-17","sourceFront":"白色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"一枝筆幾塊錢？","pinyin":"Yì zhī bǐ jǐ kuài qián?","english":"How much is a pen?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-10","sourceFront":"錢","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我有兩枝鉛筆。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu liǎng zhī qiānbǐ.","english":"I have two pencils.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-08","sourceFront":"枝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A：你要哪種筆？ B：我要鉛筆。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ yào nǎ zhǒng bǐ? B: Wǒ yào qiānbǐ.","english":"A: What kind of pen do you want? B: I want a pencil.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-04","sourceFront":"鉛筆","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這種小鉛筆怎麼樣？","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng xiǎo qiānbǐ zěnmeyàng?","english":"What do you think about this type of small pencil?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 竹(bamboo) shaft rests on a 聿(writing brush) tip → the 筆(pen)."},{"key":"[\"B4L02-2-22\",\"储蓄\",\"儲蓄\",\"储蓄\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"一個人要學會儲蓄，需要用錢的時候，就不必擔心沒錢可用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-22","sourceFront":"儲蓄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-26\",\"挑\",\"挑\",\"挑\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:這幾雙拖鞋我都喜歡，不知道怎麼挑選？ B:這容易，你挑雙便宜的就好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-26","sourceFront":"挑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"爸爸挑選西裝時，最重視的是品質，其次才是式樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-27","sourceFront":"式樣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"每個人都有夢想，只要不怕挑戰、堅持到底，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-08","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"舅舅對我很好，不管我遇到什麼挑戰，只要跟他說一聲，他一定會幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-18","sourceFront":"聲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"大偉挺喜歡他現在的工作，不但能挑戰自己，也能學習新的東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-04","sourceFront":"挺","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這家餐廳最辣的牛肉麵， 小程挑戰過好幾次，可惜都沒吃完","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-30","sourceFront":"挑戰","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"寫劇本對我來說是個很大的挑戰，但是也能得到不少收穫，所以我願意試試。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-30","sourceFront":"挑戰","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他願意挑戰自己的工作能力，並積極地克服挫折，真是難得。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-04","sourceFront":"難得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對自己的事業很熱情的人，就不怕挑戰任何困難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-34","sourceFront":"熱情","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當你面臨困難或挑戰時，也正是表現個人智慧與能力的最佳時刻。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-17","sourceFront":"面臨","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校餐廳提供各式各樣的營養食品，供學生挑選。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-06","sourceFront":"供","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只有勇敢面對挑戰、克服困難的人，才能深深體會到成就感帶來的快樂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-18","sourceFront":"成就感","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"樂觀的人會積極挑戰困難，就算無法成功也不會感到失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-24","sourceFront":"感到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A 扌(hand) points at an 兆(omen) sign, choosing which path to take → 挑(select)."},{"key":"[\"B4L05-2-18\",\"材料\",\"材料\",\"材料\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那件襯衫的材料百分之百是棉，穿起來十分舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-18","sourceFront":"材料","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"如果能好好利用食物材料，就能有效地減少廚餘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-26","sourceFront":"廚餘","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"過度消費及使用塑膠材料的產品，都會增加自然環境的負擔。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-24","sourceFront":"塑膠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個眼鏡的金屬材料相當特別，因此價格比一般眼鏡貴三成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-25","sourceFront":"金屬","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"奶油不但種類多，並且是做甜點時不能少的材料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-17","sourceFront":"奶油","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-2-18\",\"热爱\",\"熱愛\",\"热爱\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他一直熱愛翻譯工作，不論多困難都會想辦法克服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-18","sourceFront":"熱愛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他熱愛路跑活動，只要是相關比賽，一定少不了他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-32","sourceFront":"路跑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-06\",\"拜托\",\"拜託\",\"拜托\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每次有人拜託他幫忙，他都沒拒絕過，因此大家都說他是「好好先生」(yes-man)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-06","sourceFront":"拜託","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-48\",\"孙子\",\"孫子\",\"孙子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我媽媽退休後，就在家幫忙照顧孫子和孫女。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-48","sourceFront":"孫子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-32\",\"路跑\",\"路跑\",\"